I just wanted to share this because I think it's really awesome. I came across a Discord profile while chatting on 'Server Scanning Inc' which liked to [notnite.com](https://notnite.com/) in their bio.
I really like the oldschool aesthetic, the simplicity and the friend network that they have. Each page is so unique. 

One of their sites linked to [LavaTech](https://lavate.ch/) which talks about a new concept.

#### "Friend Cloud" (noun)
> A cloud for friends. A mix between Public and Private Cloud.

It would be so cool if the internet was more like what was behind the little door that I opened today. ☺️

Bonus:
I also like [c7.pm](https://c7.pm/) a lot, it has a cat that follows your mouse cursor. It's very charming and now I want a gimmick for my website too.